{"version":1,"key":"card:659","content":{"id":659,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"npm link","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的原理就是在全局的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"node_modules","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和本地的包或者项目中的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"node_modules","code":true},{"text":" 建立符号链接。","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果在一个本地的包中执行 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"npm link","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，假设这个包的名称是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"my-lib","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，执行 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"npm link","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 后会在全局 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"node_modules","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中创建一个  "},{"type":"formatted","text":"my-lib","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的符号链接指向本地的包。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"tip","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"npm root -g","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 查看全局的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"node_modules","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的位置。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"npm root -g\n/Users/t.xiong/.nvm/versions/node/v24.1.0/lib/node_modules","language":"Bash","uuid":"0e5b02e2-c557-4456-a235-548fa2197656","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果此时在项目中想使用这个包，可以执行 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"npm link my-lib","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，这个命令会在项目中的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"node_modules","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中创建一个指向全局 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"node_modules/my-lib","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的符号链接，而这个符号链接又执行你本地的源码目录，从而实现本地包源码的调试。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_98f48e74-c190-40bc-9b8d-f025244a38bd.webp","uuid":"2baaee91-52b3-48ae-9e7e-67a89da38dc8","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_98f48e74-c190-40bc-9b8d-f025244a38bd.webp","width":696},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"npm link","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可能存在的「坑」："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在寻找本地包的依赖时，会优先从本地包所在的目录进行依赖查询，而不是项目所在的目录，这就会导致可能出现重复的依赖，而这些依赖的版本可能存在冲突，甚至可能会存在多份实例（比如两个 React）"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解决办法是通过 "},{"type":"content-link","contentId":280,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","refId":292,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"peerDependices","code":true}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不重复下载依赖，或者使用 monorepo 替代 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"npm link","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"text":"直接绕过了版本管理，使用了本地的源码，无法稳定复现","type":"formatted"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果要取消对本地源码的依赖，可以使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"npm unlink my-lib","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，然后使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"npm install","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 下载发布后的包，如果需要取消将本地包链接到全局，可以在包目录执行 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"npm unlink","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或者执行全局的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"npm unlink -g my-lib","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]}],"tags":["包管理器/npm","技巧/调试","工程化"],"createTime":1767360327722,"updateTime":1776833001028,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1776833001028},"links":{"card:292":{"key":"card:292","type":"card","id":292}}}